  "summary": "• Great team player. Work well with others.\n• Expertise in full project life cycle development for implementation and integration.\n• Deep understanding of technology with focus on delivering business solutions.\n• Well understand cost vs. function in order to bring the highest profit to the company but high quality.\n• Polished leadership skills, with ability to motivate teams to increase productivity.\n• Always research, listen and accept for new ideas/Technology which help to bring the product to a higher\nquality, meet schedule dead line but live within budget.\n\nSpecialties: • Languages: XML, Java, C, C++, Visual C++, Visual C#, Visual Basic, Perl, HTML, CGI, PHP, PL/SQL, Pro C/OCCI, Pascal, Verilog, VHDL.\n• Tools: MS Visual Studio, Gnu, QT, gSOAP, vxWork/Tonado, mySQL, Oracle, ClearCase, ClearQuest,\nJDK, embedded Linux Development.\n• OS: Windows, Mac OSX, Linux, UNIX.\n• Hardware: Raid Disk Arrays, PCs, Mac, NAS, SAN, Network.\n• Others: COM, Win 32, .NET, MFC, Multithreading, Network Sockets (Windows, Linux), RS-232.",
