    "description": "Aug 2015 - Present \nSpace software\n\nAug 2014 – August \nContinue support SE&M for site problems.\nDR work off to support CMTA chassis specific.\nWorking on Software MTF as main software architecture / developer for MTF controller using Linux, c++, snmp, json and ActiveMQ.\n\nJun 2006 - Aug 2014\nResearched, Designed and implemented GUI software for “Virtual Instrument Panel” which is a touch panel functions as a controller on hardware chassis using MS Visual C#, IO Comp.\n• Design and create User Interface base on requirement and existing system concept.\n• Study the need of most users in many difference fields in order to create a final product that serve and fit the need of most users.\n\nAug 2005 – Jun 2006\nDesigned and implemented data storage agent which provide interface between other application and\ndatabase using mySQL, C++, C# and gSOAP.\n• Implement high security storage using multiple software layers to interface with the Database.\n• Create additional reliable interface to the product using gSOAP.\n• Create user interface using C# and gSOAP.\n\nApr 2004 – Aug 2005\nDesigned and implemented a queryManager which interface with Oracle Database and dealing with a very large amount of data and extreme high speed using C++, OCCI and JAVA.\n• Study and translate in coming command in a custom language and create a translation to SQL that the Database can understand.\n• Create custom query to the Database base on the incoming request from external.\n\nMar 2003 – Apr 2004\nDesigned and implemented software simulator which supports a bigger project using C and Raw network layer.\n• Design and code base on the raw network layer in order to meet the performance requirement.\n• Modify and rebuild Linux kernel to achieve a highest revolution response.\n\nFeb 2001 – Mar 2003\nEmbedded software developer: \n• Develop controller firmware using WindRiver Tornado and x86 embedded system board.\n• Design/implement SNMP Agent which live on the Embedded controller board for external control and status.",
